# Blockchain Cert Verify — Frontend

## Required Environment Variables

Copy this to `.env.local` and fill in the values:

```bash
# Ethereum RPC URL (Ganache / Sepolia / Mainnet)
NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC_URL=http://127.0.0.1:7545

# Deployed CertificateRegistryV2 contract address
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0xAaDFCf881B0f342B7DF079ee62C52a5238eDBDe1

# Chain ID (5777 for Ganache local, 11155111 for Sepolia, 1 for Mainnet)
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAIN_ID=1337

# WalletConnect / Infura project ID (optional — for wallet connections)
NEXT_PUBLIC_PROJECT_ID=

# Backend API URL (for file uploads, etc.)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001/api
```

## Quick Start

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```
